# Git author

When creating or amending commits in this repo:

- Use only the existing git user (`user.name` / `user.email`). Do not change git config.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent`, or any `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailer.
- Never set the author or committer to Cursor Agent.
- Leave the commit message as the user's work only.
